senses.gloss:
अयज्वन् a. Not sacrificing
according to the rites; godless, impious;
Ms. 11. 14, 20.

आयात a. Come, approached.
--तं Excess, superabundance (उद्रेक);
Ki. 5. 23.

आयतीगवम् ind. At the time
when cows return home;
प्रक्रांतामायतीगवं Bk. 4. 14.

आयासक a. [आ-यस्-ण्वुल्] Causing
fatigue, wearisome; troublesome;
Bh. 3. 58.
